window.products.push({"id":1127069,"name":"Premium Scented 4-Wick Candle, Salted Caramel Cake, HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co - 18 oz - Long-Lasting Jar Candle, 30-55 Hours Clean Burn Time - Notes of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLtd5JjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Long Lasting Fragrance: The Salted Caramel Cake 4-Wick Scented Candle from HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co. has a scent output like no other. Our candles are created with masterfully blended essential oils and optimized wicks that produce room-filling fragrance. Each 18-oz candle has a total burn time of 30-55 hours. True-To-Life Fragrances: Each of our candles tells a story with top, middle and bottom fragrance notes. Rich and decadent, freshly baked vanilla cake is layered with butter cream and drizzled with warm caramel sauce with a touch of orange liqueur. Finally, it’s sprinkled with crushed black walnuts. Spice Up Your Décor: Every candle comes in a sturdy glass vessel topped with a metal lid embossed with Harry Slatkin’s personal monogram. The unique, photorealistic designed wraps depict Harry’s real-life inspiration of each fragrance. After the candle is finished, the glass vessel can be repurposed around your home! Safer Clean Burning Candles: Our scented candles are made with our non-toxic proprietary paraffin wax blend and safe-to-use fragrance ingredients and only use 100% cotton lead-free wicks. Our brand is cruelty-free and does not use any type of metal that contains lead. All HomeWorx candles are safe to burn around pets. What Makes HomeWorx Different: HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co. was founded by Harry Slatkin, the “king” of home fragrance, in partnership with QVC. Every fragrance is inspired by Slatkin’s real-life experiences like where he travels, what he eats, and the things he smells on a morning walk. Our candles will fill your home with the finest true-to-life fragrance experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLtd5JjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeworx","source_asin":"B0BSNCPKFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSNCPKFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSNCPKFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
