window.products.push({"id":1127279,"name":"WaxonWare 11 Inch Non Stick Fry Pan & Skillet With Induction Bottom 100% PFOA Free German Nonstick Coating - For Stir-Frying, Shallow Frying, Deep Fry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bsR21vCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NONSTICK & PFOA Free - The Marbellous 2.0 nonstick skillet is 100% PFOA, Lead, and Cadmium free. The updated, three-layer marble non stick pan surface is 5X more effective than other nonstick frying pans. Even without oil, this small non sticking pan food doesn't grab like other skillets do! Whether frying chicken or flipping pancakes, this small nonstick skillet allows for easier cooking with the easiest cleaning. No scrubbing needed: everything rinses right off the nonstick surface! COMPATIBLE COOKING - Wherever you're cooking, this non stick pan works better than any other non stick frying pan you'll find. With the induction plate, you'll cook faster and have consistent heat across the entire 11 inch frying pan. Plus, this non stick frying pan works wherever - induction cooktop or not. Better yet, the die-cast aluminum body gives the nonstick skillet all the benefits of a cast-iron skillet or other non sticking pan: anti-warp, and dishwasher & metal-utensil safe. ERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED, STAY-COOL HANDLE - Beyond the nonstick frying pan surface, this 11 inch pan features riveted, soft-touch Bakelite handles that stay cool, even over a hot stovetop. Ergonomically designed, no other non-stick pan is comfier (or safer) to hold, plus the look of the Bakelite finish is unrivaled. It's classic, yet dynamic. If you're short on cabinet space, even for a small pan like this nonstick skillet, use the handle's hole to hang it for all in one easy access and decor. EASY CLEAN-UP - No non sticking pan in your arsenal will be easier to clean than this 11 inch nonstick frying pan. The high sides minimize splatter, even when flipping, to cut down on mess from the start. Once done, simply cool the fry pan, soak with water, and wipe the pan's surface with a sponge to remove any residue. The marble non-stick surface allows food to wipe away clean and easy. IN A RUSH? Stick the nonstick pan right in the dishwasher without any worry (unlike cast-iron skillets). MADE TO LAST - Stop your nonstick skillet search here, and buy this nonstick pan with confidence. The Marbellous 11 inch pan's die-cast aluminum body is strong enough to last a lifetime, a limited lifetime warranty ensures that you're free to test this strength of this fry pan yourself. We promise you'll love this small nonstick fry pan, but if not, we'll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bsR21vCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WaxonWare","source_asin":"B01KE41RH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KE41RH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KE41RH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
