window.products.push({"id":1127293,"name":"Provence Buffet with Wine Storage (IVORY)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q80qDX5AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring a hint of royalty, class and charm to your home with this antique white-colored Provence Buffet from Formosa Living Products. Made from carefully selected hard wood, this piece of home furniture features two ball gliding drawers with metal handle for storing your wine. The two cabinet doors at both sides of the buffet, open with a silver metal knobs to two spacious shelves for storing your dinnerware and other accessories, keeping them within arm’s reach. The plank styled lower shelf can be used to stack wine, food basket, glossy magazines and other media accessories. Elegantly designed in antique-style, this buffet is an inviting accent to any dining space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q80qDX5AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FORMOSA LIVING PRODUCTS","source_asin":"B06XZHMCK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZHMCK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZHMCK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1127294,"name":"Martex Hableland Fairgrounds Cotton Comforter Set, Full/Queen, White/Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GwFXPTLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Martex Hableland Fairgrounds Comforter Set, sisters and textile designers Susan and Katharine Hable put fresh, contemporary touches on the heritage Martex brand. The trendsetting sisters’ timeless style offers eye-catching designs for those who do not shy away from bright, vibrant, fashion-forward colors and bold geometric patterns. The Martex Hableland Fairgrounds Comforter Set sports a swirling paint-drop print on one side, which creates an abstract botanical pattern, and a graphic geo print on the other. The comforter and shams are made of 100% Cotton fabric for a super-soft finish, so you’ll enjoy a good night’s sleep in superior comfort. The Martex Hableland Fairgrounds Comforter Set is designed for ease of care; it’s machine washable and dryer safe. And, with its light palette, the comforter set pairs perfectly with the Martex Hableland Dashing Sheet Set. Comforter: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle with similar colors. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Shams: Machine wash warm with similar colors. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry medium, remove promptly. Warm iron as needed. Long known as darlings of the textile and design industries, Athens, GA-based sisters Susan and Katharine Hable layer color, texture, and form fusing an authentic sophistication and sturdy timelessness into all of their work. Hable Design creates bold graphic designs featuring Susan’s colorful hand-drawn patterns and shapes that over the years have become the hallmark of their aesthetic. The sisters founded their design company, Hable Construction, in New York City in 1999. Susan and Katharine named Hable Construction after their Texan great grandfather’s twentieth century road construction business. Set made of 100% Cotton fabric for softness and comfort; comforter fill: 100% Polyester Features paint-drop print Dandelion on front, and a geometric pattern Sawtooth on reverse Light palette pairs perfectly with the Martex Hableland Dashing Sheet Set Shams feature convenient center-back overlap closures to easily add inserts Machine washable and dryer safe Twin size dimensions: Comforter: 68W x 94L; sham: 20W x 26L Full/Queen size dimensions: Comforter: 90W x 94L; shams: 20W x 26L King size dimensions: Comforter: 108W x 94L; shams: 20W x 36L","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GwFXPTLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B092NSTWD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092NSTWD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092NSTWD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
