window.products.push({"id":1127580,"name":"Redson Backflow Incense Burner,Waterfall Incense Burner Holder,Acrylic Cover and LED Burner Crafts for Home Decor/Tea Room Decor/Yoga Room Decor(10 Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SMM1PLSOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Package included 1 * incense burner 10 * cone incense Instructions Amazing Backflow Effect: The wonderful waterfall scene is due to the special incense cones-when it burned will make a lot of small particles and down fall together.  Usage: Choose a flat, windless place, put the incense burner well.Ignite the top of the backflow cone then put it on the incense burner. Let the backflow cone burned fully, just a few minutes then you can get relax and peaceful from the sweet smell and the dreamlike waterfall show(the smog will slowly stream down) . Attention please: 1.Our backflow incense burners are handicrafts.Every incense holder is made by pure hand.So minor color difference among them should be accepted. 2.The backflow effect happens because the smoke is heavier than air.So please use it inside the room where the air is still and there is no wind,otherwise you can't see the backflow of the incense.  3.Please put the hole of the incense cone exactly to the hole of the incense holder for the effect of the backflow.  4.One incense cone lasts about 10 minutes.About 8 minutes 5.Clean: After cones burned, it will leave some liquid and ashes on the Incense Burner.Wash the Incense Burner with water, naturally dry. Quality Guarantee: Ceramic is fragile and this product has a higher risk of break due to its irregular shape, if you receive broken product, please contact us directly, We promised to send you replacement or money refund. Don't be hesitated to buy this useful products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SMM1PLSOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Redson","source_asin":"B07RL1J1C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RL1J1C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RL1J1C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
