window.products.push({"id":1127722,"name":"TASTE DRINK GO Turkish Towel Great Travel Accessories, Perfect Beach Towel, Swimsuit Cover up, Bath Towels or Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BkiQPMqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"• PERFECT SIZE: This towel is 20 inches larger than an average beach towel at 35\" by 70\" which allows it to fully cover your beach lounger. Due to its extra length, easily wraps around your body making a great sarong or beach cover up. With 20+ uses and 10 different color patterns, you'll be able to match these towels with any outfit in your wardrobe. This means you'll be looking great in any color! • BE NOTICED! This stylish Turkish towel is perfect to compliment your thoughtful clothing and lifestyle appearance. These vibrant, bright colors pop, making you stand out in a crowd. Be ready to fend off the compliments! • MAKES GREAT GIFTS! Peshtemal towels are perfect gifts as bikini or swimsuit beach coverups for women, scarfs for dressy casual outings, or an everyday throw blanket. They'll absolutely love any color in this set! • 'EXACTLY WHAT I WAS LOOKING FOR': Discover why customers recommend these to all of their friends. Maggie says, \"great after washing my hair..I wrap around my head & it doesn't get heavy\" Eva says, \"I use it as a cover up, travel towel / blanket and baby changing pad.\" And J&S raves, \"a great gift! I bought it for my sister, but I think I’m going to keep this one for myself!\" FAQs: • Washing instructions? Cold water wash and hang dry • What are recommended uses? For international travel to cover shoulders or head when visiting temples or as an airplane blanket. Great on cruise ships, camping, festivals or backpacking. Serves as a shawl for chilly nights. • Dimensions? 35 in. wide by 70 in. long •OUR PROMISE: We are very confident that you will love the practicality and style our unisex laptop bag for women or men comes packed with, but we do want you to feel safe knowing your purchase is a great investment. We stand by you and our products, so if something happens let us know. We will fix it - promise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BkiQPMqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taste Drink Go","source_asin":"B072FMRQDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1127722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072FMRQDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072FMRQDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
